    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_00",
      "hash64": "C76E70C6C35914B0",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Welcome to the Montenevera Gym,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)].",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "C76E71C6C3591663",
      "text": "Are you ready to challenge Gym Leader Ryme,\\nthe MC of RIP?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "C76E72C6C3591816",
      "text": "Very well. Allow me to show you to the\\nbattle court.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "C76E73C6C35919C9",
      "text": "Of course. Please feel free to come speak to me\\nwhenever you’re ready.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_nobattle",
      "hash64": "D0A496BAB24C009D",
      "text": "Oh! You will need at least two Pokémon fit for\\nbattle in order to challenge Ryme!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_00",
      "hash64": "F4F1D404F7C6E265",
      "text": "Yo, yo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_system_01",
      "hash64": "CDB670A9B4004749",
      "text": "It sounds like there might be a rap battle going\\non over at the stage.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_01",
      "hash64": "F4F1D304F7C6E0B2",
      "text": "This is MY time, and this is MY day!\\nYou’re not gonna stand in my way!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_02",
      "hash64": "F4F1D204F7C6DEFF",
      "text": "Listen up, Ryme—your reign ends here!\\nYou’re gonna get rung up by this pro cashier!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_system_02",
      "hash64": "CDB66DA9B4004230",
      "text": "*BOOM chhh BOOM* *BOOM chhh BOOM*",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_01",
      "hash64": "1436B0F9B1C26717",
      "text": "Pro cashier? Well, I’m about to check out.\\nMusta got your rhymes on deep discount![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_02",
      "hash64": "1436B1F9B1C268CA",
      "text": "Please—you think you can step to my game?\\nFool, I got “rhyme” right there in my name!\\c\\nI’m a specter from which there is no protector,\\nand victory unto me you will render when the\\r\\ncrowd sees you’re a mere pretender![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 181,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 220,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_03",
      "hash64": "1436B2F9B1C26A7D",
      "text": "You wanna end my reign? Yeah—keep dreamin’.\\nBuy a book of rhymes, kid, and start readin’![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_system_03",
      "hash64": "CDB66EA9B40043E3",
      "text": "*BOOM chhh BOOM* *BOOM chhh BOOM*",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_03",
      "hash64": "F4F1D104F7C6DD4C",
      "text": "I’m done—you won! My rhymes totally whiffed!\\nBut I’ll be back—maybe after my next shift!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_04",
      "hash64": "1436ABF9B1C25E98",
      "text": "Hold up! Where you goin’? That’s all you got?!\\c\\n“After my next shift”? Seriously? Bars over jokes,\\ncome on![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_05",
      "hash64": "1436ACF9B1C2604B",
      "text": "That was over way too fast. It gets boring wearin’\\nthe crown if no one makes me fight to keep it.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_06",
      "hash64": "1436ADF9B1C261FE",
      "text": "Hm?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_07",
      "hash64": "1436AEF9B1C263B1",
      "text": "Hey, my opener’s back! You here for a rap battle\\nor a Gym battle?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_select_01",
      "hash64": "0E65523F48A7AD8E",
      "text": "I’m here for a Gym battle!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_select_02",
      "hash64": "0E65513F48A7ABDB",
      "text": "I’m here for a rap battle!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_08",
      "hash64": "1436A7F9B1C257CC",
      "text": "As if I even needed to ask![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_09",
      "hash64": "1436A8F9B1C2597F",
      "text": "Hah! You got jokes! We both know why you’re\\nREALLY here.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_10",
      "hash64": "143A35F9B1C57EED",
      "text": "You were captivated by that show I put on, huh?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_11",
      "hash64": "143A34F9B1C57D3A",
      "text": "I rap what’s in my soul, baby. Weavin’ words into\\na symphony of poetry.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_12",
      "hash64": "143A33F9B1C57B87",
      "text": "Don’t try it with me—you won’t last one round.\\nI’m like Sableye: my Mean Look’ll lock you down!\\c\\nLike that! You feel me?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_13",
      "hash64": "143A32F9B1C579D4",
      "text": "Heh. Well, let’s get to it—you’re a Pokémon\\nTrainer. So battle me, and show me who you are![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_14",
      "hash64": "143A31F9B1C57821",
      "text": "My music’s not all that tops the charts—my skills\\nwith Ghost types are the best around![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_15",
      "hash64": "143A30F9B1C5766E",
      "text": "Lest you forget it, the name is Ryme, and I’m\\nknown as the MC of RIP![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_16",
      "hash64": "143A2FF9B1C574BB",
      "text": "Dead or alive, let’s make this a vibe![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_17",
      "hash64": "143A2EF9B1C57308",
      "text": "Hah! Great battle—chilling AND thrilling![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_18",
      "hash64": "143A2DF9B1C57155",
      "text": "You’ve got spirit, kid. You earned my Gym\\nBadge, all right![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_19",
      "hash64": "143A2CF9B1C56FA2",
      "text": "And how about a VIP pass for my next show, too?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_badge",
      "hash64": "0D82A4DAAE6440AF",
      "text": "With [VAR 0x0200(0001)] Gym Badge[VAR 0x1101(0001,0100)]s, it’ll be easier to catch\\nPokémon of up to Lv. [VAR 0x0201(0002)], and they’ll listen to\\r\\nwhat you have to say, too![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0200",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_badge_all",
      "hash64": "6C44FEFFDFD72743",
      "text": "With 8 Gym Badges, you’ll be able to catch\\nPokémon of any level, and they’ll be sure to\\r\\nlisten to what you have to say, too![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_waza",
      "hash64": "A108F704076F9DE5",
      "text": "I’m feelin’ so good that I think I’m also gonna let\\nyou have this![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_20",
      "hash64": "143D9BF9B1C86216",
      "text": "Too bad it’s over! Make your way back to my\\nstage sometime. Maybe next time, we rap battle\\r\\ninstead. Who knows?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
